      "created_at": "2014-06-04T19:18:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok... while Vengence was fun... it got old quick... and the villian team has gone unplayed for the past 2 months.<br>When can we expect to see another SotM expansion?</p><p>I<span>&nbsp;am not looking for a firm date.. but a ballpark would be nice Q4 2014...Q2 2015... Fall 2015...?&nbsp;</span></p><p><br>I have some <strong><em>$$$</em></strong> earmarked for gaming I want to spend or reserve.&nbsp;During the summer I host gaming nights nearly every weekend... and either I want to have something new, or at least reserved for an anticipated purchase of a product in the works...<span>I would be more than happy to plan for the purchase/kickstarter/pre-order...<br><br>Any data will be welcome.&nbsp;</span>.. and wanted to give SotM the first look before I start poking around Fanatsy Flight Games, Asmodee, or Days of Wonder...&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Thanks</span></p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:30.786Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
