      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Ok... while Vengence was fun... it got old quick... and the villian team has gone unplayed for the past 2 months.<br />When can we expect to see another SotM expansion?</p><p>I<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;am not looking for a firm date.. but a ballpark would be nice Q4 2014...Q2 2015... Fall 2015...?&nbsp;</span></p><p><br />I have some <strong><em>$$$</em></strong> earmarked for gaming I want to spend or reserve.&nbsp;During the summer I host gaming nights nearly every weekend... and either I want to have something new, or at least reserved for an anticipated purchase of a product in the works...<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">I would be more than happy to plan for the purchase/kickstarter/pre-order...<br /><br />Any data will be welcome.&nbsp;</span>.. and wanted to give SotM the first look before I start poking around Fanatsy Flight Games, Asmodee, or Days of Wonder...&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thanks</span></p><p><br /><br />&nbsp;</p>",
