      "id": 105578,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-04T19:27:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wrath of the Cosmos is still a bit away. Playtesting, as of writing this, has not started for it as we are still working through Tactics related stuff (for which I really hope you got in on the Kickstarter, as that game is going to be a genre buster for sure).</p><p>With Tactics looking at a December delivery, I'd be surprised to see another SotM expansion ship to consumers in 2014. However, I certainly do not speak on their behalf, and playtesting SotM stuff nowadays (especially a non-mega expansion) goes very quickly. I am totally up for being surprised though.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:35:13.659Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
