      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Wrath of the Cosmos is still a bit away. Playtesting, as of writing this, has not started for it as we are still working through Tactics related stuff (for which I really hope you got in on the Kickstarter, as that game is going to be a genre buster for sure).</p><p>With Tactics looking at a December delivery, I&#39;d be surprised to see another SotM expansion ship to consumers in 2014. However, I certainly do not speak on their behalf, and playtesting SotM stuff nowadays (especially a non-mega expansion) goes very quickly. I am totally up for being surprised though.</p>",
