      "created_at": "2014-06-04T21:38:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Funny how people say SotM gets old. I haven't found that at all and I play all the time, 8 games a week on average. Try randomising rather than choosing your heroes/villains/environments, that keeps things a little fresher.&nbsp;</p>",
